abstract: >-
  One structured record for each of the 78 cards of the Rider-Waite-Smith tarot deck:
  A. E. Waite's divinatory meanings from The Pictorial Key to the Tarot (1911) and the
  Golden Dawn correspondences as printed in The Equinox, vol. I, no. 8 (1912), compiled
  from the historical sources and checked against page images.
